{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_074_1000_025roc", "source_sha256": "4c344cb8b6c512b6564c354bc2cfdf52635eb2bec4550ba0455951e2ee583662", "ja": "アンナ！　この間のゲームで\nロコのガーデンを作ってみたので、\nさっそくマルチプレイしましょう！", "zh": "安娜！我在前阵子的游戏里试着建了一个ROCO的庭院，所以我们马上来多人游戏吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_074_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "541d50255436be5664ee1c0584d01e35045b1dd9026c135a2c734dff7be1b86c", "ja": "ん……杏奈も、準備完了……\nレベルも上げて、\n装備も、揃えてあるよ……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈也准备好啦……\n等级练上去了，\n装备也都……备齐了哦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_074_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "750f707d9740c944f2914257b8ae4f45f5d86a2f2f46e14d1194186c5bea735d", "ja": "あら、それって\n人と一緒に遊べるのね。\n何をするゲームなの？", "zh": "哎呀，原来那个\n能和别人一起玩啊。\n是什么类型的游戏呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_074_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "049ab240192b3497aa7c0b6d7c087a8d10e0bebbd01ad91d71af875f025b0dc6", "ja": "サンドボックス、ゲーム……。\n同じマップで、友達と一緒に\n遊んだり、冒険したり……。", "zh": "沙盒游戏……\n在同一张地图里，和朋友一起玩、一起冒险……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_074_1004_025roc", "source_sha256": "63416fddbe11c463ed467a4f9998c56375139377272423ab1214cc56ab451039", "ja": "みんなで一緒に、\nゲームの世界をクリエイト\nできるんですよ！", "zh": "大家可以一起\n创造游戏里的世界哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_chat_074_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_074_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "c96f31347fcd6012e4b2b36bf4aac7a09659d179131985041659743b190a480c", "ja": "あら、面白そうじゃない！\n私にも教えてくれる？", "zh": "哎呀，听起来挺有意思的嘛！\n也能教教我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
